menu "SQLite Pipe example"
    config MM_SQLITE_EXAMPLE_PROVISION
        bool "Provision a fresh demonstration database if missing"
        default n
    config MM_SQLITE_EXAMPLE_FAIL_SYNC
        bool "Exercise a failed file synchronization before collection"
        default n
        help
            The example returns EIO from the next fsync during an append,
            closes the handle and checks the recovered Pipe before continuing.
endmenu
